    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Embrace Death and Wield Ghostly Power</p></blockquote><p>Some Rogues walk the veil between life and death, guiding foes to the grave and slipping through the world as unseen as a spirit. Along the way, a Rogue might discover a mystical bond with death itself. Steeped in negative energy, such a Rogue infuses their strikes with deathly power and steals knowledge from the souls of the departed. Thieves' guilds prize these Rogues as superb information gatherers and spies.</p><h3>Phantom Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.X2k6RNsP0yTZ2Is6]{Wails from the Grave}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.XYSMnWwQzrnCribX]{Whispers of the Dead}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iWSOy8eJoKsjfuTV]{Tokens of the Departed}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.3OuWamgjxlcSdG2Z]{Voice of Death}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jNaBHpC2HFsHWhFS]{Ghost Walk}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.C2ZJNEKbKj32ojIL]{Death's Friend}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
